          <Ring1>
            <Name>Ring of Thelis</Name>
            <Icon>Ring_12e</Icon>
            <Description>This silver ring has been engraved with arcane runes. It was said to have been
owned by a renowned sorcerer Thelis, who vanished nearly a century ago while
investigating the disappearance of several adventurers in the ruins beneath
Stormreach.</Description>
